<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Shakes</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Luke Hemmings</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">boy</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3O7CKRzUtXwdsYCjv8lOoj</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.707" end="00:15.777">Lost in the morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.777" end="00:18.813">Time starts to crawl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.813" end="00:21.857">Can we share the lonely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.857" end="00:25.069">If my heart is small?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.069" end="00:28.193">Your touch is deadly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.193" end="00:31.187">And I wanna call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.187" end="00:36.996">Is it better to feel this or feel nothing at all?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.996" end="00:38.496" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.812" end="00:40.208">Honey, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.208" end="00:41.708">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.686" end="00:44.102">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.102" end="00:47.532">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.532" end="00:50.287">I can't shake this feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.287" end="00:52.577">Boy, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.577" end="00:54.077">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.019" end="00:56.400">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.400" end="00:59.865">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.865" end="01:02.609">Can't shake this feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.609" end="01:08.807">Shake, shake, shake, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.807" end="01:14.158">Shake, shake, shake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.158" end="01:15.658" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.600" end="01:17.683">I feel it coming</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.683" end="01:20.065">My blood is wine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.065" end="01:23.890">Oh, I can't help but chase you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.890" end="01:26.182">My butterfly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.182" end="01:29.508">I wanna go out in my sleep now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.508" end="01:32.712">So I don't feel no pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.712" end="01:36.678">The city tends to move on all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.678" end="01:39.804" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.804" end="01:42.132">Honey, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.132" end="01:43.632">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.523" end="01:46.035">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.035" end="01:49.429">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.429" end="01:52.187">I can't shake this feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.187" end="01:54.430">Boy, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.430" end="01:55.930">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.930" end="01:58.304">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.304" end="02:01.790">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.790" end="02:04.481">Can't shake this feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.481" end="02:10.746">Shake, shake, shake, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.746" end="02:16.118">Shake, shake, shake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.118" end="02:17.618" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.594" end="02:24.594">I just want to be, I just want to be yours (Shake, shake, shake, ooh, shake, shake, shake)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.999" end="02:36.999">I just want to be, I just want to be yours (Shake, shake, shake, ooh, shake, shake, shake)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.009" end="02:42.509" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.621" end="02:44.060">Honey, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.060" end="02:45.560">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.523" end="02:47.868">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.868" end="02:51.349">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.349" end="02:54.172">I can't shake this feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.172" end="02:56.350">Boy, I just wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.350" end="02:57.890">Wanna be yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.890" end="03:00.322">Inside your dreams tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.322" end="03:03.782">Oh no, oh no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.782" end="03:07.782">Can't shake this feeling</p></div></body></tt>